{
  "source": "Prompts/work-with-ai-opener-3.mp4",
  "duration": 153.901875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.54,
      "text": "This graphic outlines our operating rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.02,
      "end": 7.7,
      "text": "Getting useful answers requires aiming your requests and verifying results."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.62,
      "end": 9.28,
      "text": "Look at the final line."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.76,
      "end": 12.02,
      "text": "Over the next lessons, we'll examine this idea."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.9,
      "end": 14.56,
      "text": "Your logic drives the process."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.3,
      "end": 17.26,
      "text": "The machine simply scales that effort."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 20.18,
      "text": "You've seen what these models can do conceptually."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.62,
      "end": 23.58,
      "text": "Now we are going to look at how to actually operate them."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.04,
      "end": 26.12,
      "text": "Before we generate any complex work,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.12,
      "end": 29.66,
      "text": "we have to establish a deliberate method for interacting with the software."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.5,
      "end": 33.52,
      "text": "Two people ask the same AI model for a project summary."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.24,
      "end": 37.76,
      "text": "One gets a scattered draft, the other gets a structured document."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.34,
      "end": 41.36,
      "text": "Receiving a messy draft, you might assume the software is broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.08,
      "end": 44.3,
      "text": "But the exact same engine powers both sides."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.02,
      "end": 47.6,
      "text": "The only variable shifting was human input."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.26,
      "end": 52.9,
      "text": "Getting high quality work out of these systems requires us to examine our own methodology."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.9,
      "end": 56.0,
      "text": "A physical comparison helps illustrate this point."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.58,
      "end": 59.54,
      "text": "Imagine two people standing in front of the exact same launch,"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.82,
      "end": 61.38,
      "text": "holding two identical smartphones."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.28,
      "end": 66.24,
      "text": "The first person pulls out the phone, presses the button quickly without checking the frame,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.66,
      "end": 68.64,
      "text": "and captures a blurry crooked image."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.42,
      "end": 72.34,
      "text": "The second person aligns the guidelines on the screen,"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.86,
      "end": 76.36,
      "text": "taps to focus the lens, and captures a crisp centered shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.02,
      "end": 80.7,
      "text": "The lenses, the sensors, and the image processors inside those phones"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.7,
      "end": 82.6,
      "text": "never changed during this process."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.4,
      "end": 85.9,
      "text": "An AI model operates by the exact same logic."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.62,
      "end": 91.84,
      "text": "Generating a precise output depends entirely on the operator knowing how to direct the hardware."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.68,
      "end": 97.06,
      "text": "This roadmap lays out the start to finish workflow we will practice to become deliberate operators."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.26,
      "end": 99.7,
      "text": "First, know what it's for."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.44,
      "end": 104.32,
      "text": "We will identify why AI requires a different approach from traditional software"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.32,
      "end": 107.4,
      "text": "and pinpoint the specific tasks it handles best."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.34,
      "end": 109.64,
      "text": "Second, use it well."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.64,
      "end": 114.88,
      "text": "We will practice giving the model specific details to steer it toward a better answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.88,
      "end": 117.5,
      "text": "and look at how the software actually reads your prompts."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.24,
      "end": 119.96,
      "text": "Third, think before you trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.66,
      "end": 127.44,
      "text": "You must question the generated response and verify the facts before deciding if the output is ready to deploy."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.3,
      "end": 132.86,
      "text": "Applying this specific sequence gives you control over the final output,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.12,
      "end": 135.72,
      "text": "rather than hoping the software guesses correctly."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.56,
      "end": 138.5,
      "text": "We return to our starting banner."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.5,
      "end": 143.58,
      "text": "Generating good material is an active human-driven process."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.52,
      "end": 147.16,
      "text": "Your cognitive effort determines the quality of the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.88,
      "end": 150.22,
      "text": "The machine simply scales that effort."
    }
  ],
